Description: Visual PulseAudio routing editor (GTK3)
 Audio Spider is a flow-graph editor for PulseAudio. Drag virtual sinks,
 combine real speakers into groups, and route inputs to outputs by drawing
 loopbacks on a canvas. Configuration is persisted to
 $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/audio_spider/config.json and re-applied at login.
 .
 Supports headless application of a saved config (--headless), tray-icon
 minimisation, and live PulseAudio event reconciliation.
